    {
      "id": "zn_txt_sphinx001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -900,
      "y": -760,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 🛡️ Rigid 1,280-Byte Constant-Size Sphinx Onion Packets\n- **3-Hop Cryptographic Peeling**: `Origin ➔ Guard Node ➔ Mix Relay ➔ Exit Node ➔ Recipient`\n- **ChaCha20-Poly1305 + X25519 + Ed25519**: Per-hop ephemeral ECDH keys with authenticated AEAD framing.\n- **Fixed 1,280-Byte Wire MTU**: Every packet is padded to the exact IPv6 minimum MTU — zero packet-size correlation or DPI leaks.\n- **Kademlia α=3 XOR DHT + RFC 5389 STUN**: 256 buckets (k=20), UDP :42069 local broadcast beacons, and 500-slot ZASF store-and-forward offline mailbox."
    },
    {
      "id": "zn_txt_gossip001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1360,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 1220,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "### 📡 6 Broadcast Mesh Channels & 5 \"Regular Joe\" First Flight Scenarios\n- **GossipSub (D=6) Channels**: 🌐 `#all` · 📢 `#general` · 🚨 `#emergency` · 🤝 `#trade` · 🌲 `#off-grid` · 🛠️ `#dev`\n- **Quick Signal Toolbar**: `🚨 SOS Alert` · `◈ Request VLR` · `📍 Drop Pin` · `🤝 Barter` · `📎 CAS File` (1h / 24h / 7d / perm TTL)\n- **5 Interactive First Flight Scenarios**:\n  1. 🌪️ **Hurricane & Grid Outage**: 0-Bar phone-to-phone walkie-talkie hop chain (60 yds ➔ 140 yds ➔ 300 yds).\n  2. 🏟️ **Stadium 5G Congestion**: 75,000-fan crowd-surfing wave text (8ms hop vs 99.4% jammed cell tower).\n  3. 🤝 **Yard Sale & Farmers Market**: $0.00 fee offline bicycle checkout (35.00 VLR) + +25.00 VLR instant faucet.\n  4. ☕ **Public Wi-Fi Snooper Shield**: Live byte-weight gauge proving constant 1,280-byte Sphinx wire padding.\n  5. 🚨 **Neighborhood SOS & Beacon**: Zero-account community hazard & lost-pet local broadcast."
    },
