    {
      "id": "zn_txt_vaelor002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": -760,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### ◈ Vaelor L1 Feeless DAG & Proof-of-Relay (+5.00 VLR)\n- **0.00 VLR ($0.00) Gas Fees Forever**: Asynchronous dual-state (`SEND` + `RECV`) per-account Ed25519 micro-chains.\n- **14.2ms (<18ms) Finality**: Instant frontier confirmation with strict mathematical balance conservation ($\\sum \\Delta B = 0$).\n- **+5.00 VLR Proof-of-Relay (PoR)**: Automatic protocol rewards credited to relay nodes routing Sphinx & GossipSub packets.\n- **+15.9 VLR Proof-of-Useful-Work (PoUW)**: Minted for Neuro-Memory STDP & Obsidian Second Brain cognitive indexing (:8094)."
    },
    {
      "id": "zn_txt_zml000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 740,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### ⚡ ZML (Zoth Markup Language) & 11 Built-In ZothApps\n- **1.4ms Client-Side AST Compiler**: Authors complete zero-cloud P2P apps in 5–15 lines (`HEADER`, `AMBIENT_DEVICE_AUTH`, `GRID`, `ITEM`, `PAY_LINK`, `CART_BAR`, `RECEIPT_BOX`).\n- **11 Built-in ZothApps (`zoth://<slug>`)**: `welcome`, `ghost-notes`, `mesh-board`, `storefront`, `zoth-drive`, `zoth-radio`, `zoth-chat`, `zoth-wallet`, `names` (.zoth ZNS), `zoth-vault`, `zoth-pub`."
    },
