    {
      "id": "zn_txt_apk000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1360,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### 🤖 Android 17 (API 37) PIE Native APK (`zothnet-arm64.apk`)\n- **Verified on Google Pixel 10 Pro**: Cross-compiled `CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=android GOARCH=arm64 go build -buildmode=pie` packaged as `lib/arm64-v8a/libzothnet.so` (SELinux W^X compliant).\n- **`ZothNetService.java` ForegroundService**: Persistent notification channel (`zothnet_mesh_channel`) prevents OS background freeze.\n- **Deep Sleep Resilience**: `PowerManager.PARTIAL_WAKE_LOCK` (`ZothNet::MeshKeepAlive`) + `WifiManager.MulticastLock` (`ZothNetMulticast`) keep UDP :42069 & DHT active with screen off.\n- **Signed v1+v2+v3+v4**: `4600915e5837a6cf504401dbc158d02f5fd0d02d33e9de7097c9ed264332e69c`"
    },
    {
      "id": "zn_txt_relay0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -460,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### 📡 24/7 Dedicated Relay Node Guide (Moto G 2025 / Moto G Stylus / VPS)\n1. **Moto G 2025 & Moto G Stylus 24/7 Home/Field Relay**:\n   - Install `zothnet-arm64.apk` via ADB or `zothnet.nullai.tech/downloads/zothnet-arm64.apk`.\n   - Set Android **Battery Usage ➔ Unrestricted** so `PARTIAL_WAKE_LOCK` stays active 24/7.\n   - Leaves UDP :42069 beacon, 3-hop Sphinx relay, and 500-slot ZASF offline mailbox running continuously while earning `+5.00 VLR` PoR rewards.\n2. **Linux VPS 24/7 WAN Relay Anchor**:\n   - `curl -fsSL https://zothnet.nullai.tech/install.sh | bash`\n   - `zothnet run --alias \"VPS-Relay-Anchor\" --port 42069`"
    },
